# Select your environment in the Xrm Tools toolbar.
# Relative URLs resolve against that environment's /api/data/v9.2/ root.
# Send Request authenticates at execution time; no tokens belong in this file.
@limit = 5

### Current user
GET /WhoAmI

### Account names
GET /accounts?$select=accountid,name&$top={{limit}}
Prefer: odata.include-annotations="*"

### Metadata
GET /EntityDefinitions?$select=LogicalName,DisplayName

### Test
GET https://services.odata.org/TripPinRESTierService/People

### POST TEST
POST /accounts

{
  "name": "Test Account"
